</table>
<p></p>
<p>(a) Computing the average length of service:</p>
<p>\(e^0_x=\frac{{@T0@}}{{@l0@}}={@ta1@}\)</p>
<p></p>
<p>(b) A steady intake of \(l_o={@l0@}\) new employees would produce a staff of \(T_o= {@T0@}\) for company B.</p>
<p>Hence, for the total staff in this case is to be maintained at \({@no_of_staff@}\),
the annual intake should be \(=l_0 (\frac{\text{required employees}}{T_o}) ={@l0@} \times \frac{{@no_of_staff@}}{{@T0@}}={@ta2@}\)  persons.</p>]]></text>
